OL,5,G0600 Radio Wales Arts Show
OL,6,     FGary Raymond is joined by writer
OL,7,     Fand art curator Peter Wakelin,
OL,8,     Fplaywright Tim Rhys, producer
OL,9,     FAlison Gerrish, Carys Tudor of
